# Shared script declarations
@scenario tutorial_lesson_35
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[stage clear]
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set tutorial_source scripts/tutorial/35_shared_declarations.vns]
[set tutorial_excerpt reuse]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: The map and the lessons import common project definitions. Here is a room background and a position from the shared file.
# region reuse
[bg room]
[show ginger rightmark thoughtful]
# endregion
ginger: Open scripts/definitions/characters.vns and change the X value for rightmark from 0.78 to 0.68. Reopen this lesson and run Character movement. Both scripts use that definition.
> Show the position again -> start
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Practice exercise -> practice
> Review question -> check
@label return_hub
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[if !tutorial_done_35]
[flag tutorial_done_35]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_7]
[end]

@label practice
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: What should stay fixed when checking your X-position edit?
> Change the expressions too. -> practice_hint
> Keep the pose and viewport fixed. -> practice_result
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label practice_hint
ginger: Hold the pose and viewport constant, then compare the horizontal position.
[jump practice]
@label practice_result
ginger: Hold the pose and viewport constant, then compare the horizontal position.
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
> Review question -> check
> Try the interactive lab again -> start
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Where should you edit rightmark for all the importing lessons?
> The shared declarations file. -> correct
> Each sprite image separately. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: The include supplies the named position to every importing script.
[jump check]
@label correct
ginger: The include supplies the named position to every importing script.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
